material excluded below. A later version of this license does not replace the
terms for a copy you already received unless you choose that later version.

Material already distributed under MIT, including the repository at commit
6d83af64512bb0853b007a89f9f71b16f16d5143 and its ancestors, remains available
under MIT. Part B preserves the historic notice and permission text. The same
applies to any other material previously distributed under MIT, including on
parallel branches. Incorporating or modifying such material does not withdraw
its MIT permissions or apply Part A to the pre-existing portions. Those
permissions include commercial and institutional use, modification and resale.

Third-party components and attributed external material remain under their own
terms. These terms neither replace those terms nor claim rights in unprotected
material, learner records, user-supplied content or generated learner output.
No copyrightability or exclusive ownership of AI-generated elements is asserted.
Nothing here restricts rights under applicable law, including copyright
