2. Free personal learning permission

Subject to these terms, the licensor grants each individual a worldwide,
nonexclusive, royalty-free copyright license to download, install, run, copy,
study and modify the Covered Material for independent personal self-study.
You may create adaptations for that purpose. Personal study may improve your
career prospects; that alone does not make it professional use. Being a student,
teacher or employee does not by itself disqualify your independent self-study.

Independent personal self-study means learning for yourself, on your own behalf,
outside a course, service, deployment or training program operated, administered
or assigned by a professional teacher or organization. No Nina license fee is
required for this permission, including when using your own API key (BYOK) or
eligible personal Codex access. Provider fees and provider terms remain separate;
this license supplies no account, subscription, service allowance or feature.

