Except as expressly allowed in sections 4 and 5, this license does not permit
professional teaching or tutoring, provision of learning services to others,
or use by or on behalf of a school, university, employer, business, government,
charity or other organization. This includes classroom use, assigned coursework,
institution-operated learning, employee training, managed deployments and hosted
access. There is no blanket educational, charitable or nonprofit exception:
these uses require separate written permission even if no fee is charged.
Selling, renting, licensing for payment or commercially exploiting the Covered
Material also requires separate written permission from the relevant rightsholder.
Contact Pedro Azevedo Minutetnag at pedro.azvm@gmail.com to request permission;
a request, product plan description or provider subscription is not permission.

4. Inspection and public information

Anyone may read and inspect the published source and documentation, copy them
as needed for that inspection, and report problems or propose changes. Anyone
